{"id":"7abdef002bccc371","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-p-adic-zeta.md","title":"$p$-adic Zeta Function","display":"df-p-adic-zeta — $p$-adic Zeta Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-p-adic-zeta","aliases":["58-df-p-adic-zeta"],"display":"df-p-adic-zeta — $p$-adic Zeta Function","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-kubota-leopoldt.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-p-adic-zeta"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-p-adic-zeta</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-p-adic-zeta — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-adic Zeta Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4d3551c550ac217a\" href=\"?note=4d3551c550ac217a\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-kubota-leopoldt.md\">../batch10/58-df-kubota-leopoldt.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3322615e4eea05e9\" href=\"?note=3322615e4eea05e9\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-prime.md\">../batch20/58-df-prime.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7101d8e1cbc25a43\" href=\"?note=7101d8e1cbc25a43\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md\">../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\omega\">\\(p\\in\\omega\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\">\\(\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\)</span> (prime predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3322615e4eea05e9\" href=\"?note=3322615e4eea05e9\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-prime.md\">../batch20/58-df-prime.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S\\)</span> (Dirichlet 特征谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7101d8e1cbc25a43\" href=\"?note=7101d8e1cbc25a43\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md\">../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KubotaLeopoldt}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KubotaLeopoldt}_S\\)</span> (Kubota–Leopoldt <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-进 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 函数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4d3551c550ac217a\" href=\"?note=4d3551c550ac217a\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-kubota-leopoldt.md\">../batch10/58-df-kubota-leopoldt.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta_p\">\\(\\zeta_p\\)</span> (主特征分支的 Kubota–Leopoldt <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-进 ζ 函数)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}adic\\text{-}zeta}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PadicZeta}_p(\\zeta_p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\land\n\\exists\\chi_{0,p}\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi_{0,p},p)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\left(\n\\chi_{0,p}(n)=\\begin{cases}0,&amp;p\\mid n,\\\\1,&amp;p\\nmid n,\n\\end{cases}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{KubotaLeopoldt}_S(\\zeta_p,p,\\chi_{0,p})\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}adic\\text{-}zeta}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PadicZeta}_p(\\zeta_p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\land\n\\exists\\chi_{0,p}\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi_{0,p},p)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\left(\n\\chi_{0,p}(n)=\\begin{cases}0,&amp;p\\mid n,\\\\1,&amp;p\\nmid n,\n\\end{cases}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{KubotaLeopoldt}_S(\\zeta_p,p,\\chi_{0,p})\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>直接复用主 Dirichlet 特征的 Kubota–Leopoldt 谓词，使 Teichmüller 扭曲、奇偶分支与解析域全部继承精确定义。</li>\n<li>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p-1\\mid n\">\\(p-1\\mid n\\)</span> 时扭曲退化为平凡特征，得到经典特殊值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta_p(1-n)=-(1-p^{n-1})B_n/n\">\\(\\zeta_p(1-n)=-(1-p^{n-1})B_n/n\\)</span>；把该式无条件要求于所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span> 会把不同权空间分支错误合并。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-adic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-functions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_p(s, \\chi)\">\\(L_p(s, \\chi)\\)</span> interpolate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-values.</li>\n<li>Iwasawa theory: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta_p\">\\(\\zeta_p\\)</span> is related to Iwasawa invariants.</li>\n<li>Leopoldt conjecture: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_p(1, \\chi) \\neq 0\">\\(L_p(1, \\chi) \\neq 0\\)</span> for non-trivial <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-kubota-leopoldt.md","status":"resolved","id":"4d3551c550ac217a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-kubota-leopoldt.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-prime.md","status":"resolved","id":"3322615e4eea05e9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md","status":"resolved","id":"7101d8e1cbc25a43","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-prime.md","status":"resolved","id":"3322615e4eea05e9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p\\in\\omega$ and $\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)$ (prime predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md","status":"resolved","id":"7101d8e1cbc25a43","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S$ (Dirichlet 特征谓词, see [[../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-kubota-leopoldt.md","status":"resolved","id":"4d3551c550ac217a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KubotaLeopoldt}_S$ (Kubota–Leopoldt $p$-进 $L$ 函数谓词, see [[../batch10/58-df-kubota-leopoldt.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KubotaLeopoldt}_S","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\zeta_p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}adic\\text{-}zeta}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PadicZeta}_p(\\zeta_p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\land\n\\exists\\chi_{0,p}\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi_{0,p},p)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\left(\n\\chi_{0,p}(n)=\\begin{cases}0,&p\\mid n,\\\\1,&p\\nmid n,\n\\end{cases}\\right)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{KubotaLeopoldt}_S(\\zeta_p,p,\\chi_{0,p})\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"p-1\\mid n","display":false},{"tex":"\\zeta_p(1-n)=-(1-p^{n-1})B_n/n","display":false},{"tex":"n>0","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"L_p(s, \\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\zeta_p","display":false},{"tex":"L_p(1, \\chi) \\neq 0","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false}],"bytes":1768,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-930","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-p-adic-zeta.md|58-df-p-adic-zeta]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["4d3551c550ac217a","3322615e4eea05e9","7101d8e1cbc25a43"]}